/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 46 0 R
/E (The Smart Automatic Attendance Analyzer System is a desktop utility designed to automate the aggregation and scoring of student attendance from disparate session logs. By processing directories of Microsoft Teams exports and Excel files, the system generates a unified performance report, providing instructors with tabular data and visual analytics.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [3]
>>
